<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">开发验证</text><view class="title">充值测试准备</view>
  <view wx:if="{{locked}}" class="card"><view class="heading">恢复或处理旧测试记录</view><view class="small">{{localHint}}</view><view wx:if="{{reference}}" class="result" selectable>学校订单号：{{reference}}</view><view class="small">“已有提交记录”是本机防重复提交标记，不代表已经付款。旧版本重启后可能丢失付款链接。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="recoverCheckout" loading="{{recovering}}" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">恢复本单付款链接</button><button wx:if="{{hasCheckout && canPreviewCheckout}}" class="primary" bindtap="openCheckout" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">查看学校收银台</button><button wx:if="{{hasCheckout}}" class="secondary" bindtap="copyCheckout" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">去浏览器付款</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="routeDiagnostics" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">查看本单路由诊断（不下单）</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="archiveUnpaid" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">清除旧记录，重新测试</button><view class="small">归档不取消学校订单。已付款、可能扣款或结果不确定时，请先查单，勿使用归档重新下单。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!checked && orderMessage}}" class="card query-status" role="status">{{orderMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{recoveryMessage}}" class="card query-status" role="status">{{recoveryMessage}}</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">第一步：检查本人校园卡</view><view class="small">读取学校余额、可选充值金额与渠道。此操作不创建订单、不付款。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="login">登录或切换学校账号</button><button class="primary" bindtap="check" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">读取本人余额与充值配置</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{checked}}" class="card"><view class="heading">学校配置已读到</view><view class="small">账号尾号 {{account}} · {{time}}</view><view class="result">学校一卡通余额：¥ {{balance}}</view><view class="result">学校预设金额（元）：{{amounts}}</view><view class="result">学校返回渠道：{{channels}}</view><view class="small">配置可读不代表本小程序已获支付授权。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{checked}}" class="card"><view class="heading">第二步：创建学校收银台订单</view><view class="small">开发测试：提交真实订单，不自动扣款。当前渠道为网页收银台，不会在本小程序内弹出微信付款。</view><picker wx:if="{{choices.length}}" range="{{choices}}" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="select" disabled="{{busy || locked}}"><view class="result">预设金额：{{choices[selected]}} 元 ⌄</view></picker><input class="field" type="digit" placeholder="自定义金额（5 至 1000 元）" value="{{customAmount}}" bindinput="inputAmount" disabled="{{busy || locked}}" /><view class="small">填写自定义金额时，以输入金额为准，最多两位小数。</view><view wx:if="{{!canOrder}}" class="small">学校未提供完整的网页支付渠道，暂不下单。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="create" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering || locked || !canOrder}}" loading="{{busy}}">创建真实充值订单</button><view wx:if="{{locked}}" class="small">已有提交记录。请使用上方恢复入口继续付款，或确认旧单未付款后归档；不要为绕过保护清空小程序数据。</view><view wx:if="{{reference}}" class="result" selectable>学校订单号：{{reference}}</view><button wx:if="{{hasCheckout && canPreviewCheckout}}" class="primary" bindtap="openCheckout" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">查看学校收银台</button><button wx:if="{{hasCheckout}}" class="secondary" bindtap="copyCheckout" disabled="{{busy || statusBusy || recovering}}">去浏览器付款</button><view class="small">{{orderMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">查询已有订单（不下单）</view><view class="small">输入结果链接中 partnerjourno 的数字流水号，或查询本页已创建的订单。使用当前学校配置的网页支付渠道查询；其他渠道可能不匹配，查询失败不代表未付款。</view><view class="small">{{localHint}}</view><input class="field" type="text" maxlength="64" placeholder="学校订单流水号" value="{{queryReference}}" bindinput="inputReference" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="queryOrder" disabled="{{statusBusy}}"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="queryOrder" loading="{{statusBusy}}" disabled="{{statusBusy || busy}}">只查询已有订单状态</button><view wx:if="{{statusMessage}}" class="card query-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{statusMessage}}</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="heading">付款与到账尚未确认</view><view class="small">本页目前不能原生调起微信付款。若选择继续在学校收银台付款，请本人核对金额、校园卡和收款方。下单成功不代表付款成功；付款成功也不代表校园卡即时到账，以学校查询结果为准。webSuccess 是结果回跳页，不是继续付款的收银台；在官方 App 创建的订单，应回到该 App 原来的收银台继续操作。</view></view>
</view>
